= macOS
<macos>
All the tools can be installed using #link("http://brew.sh/")[Homebrew]:

```console
$ # ARM GCC debugger
$ brew install arm-none-eabi-gdb

$ # Minicom
$ brew install minicom

$ # lsusb (list connected USB devices)
$ brew install lsusb
```

That's all! Go to the #link("verify.md")[next section].
